B8a character-for-character: Then compare MLB with status and, if they differ, run bts set-contest-streak --date TODAY --streak N --best-streak B --saver S --picks-dir DIR with TODAY set to the current ET date before its first lineup check. If that check has started, have Eric verify MLB and any pending or delivered pick before acting on the pick. If the state differs while the slate is unlocked and a later lineup check or fallback refresh remains, have Eric run the same command between checks.
B8a character-for-character: On a warning after a delivery: use the warning's command only if the delivered pick's slate and today's ET date both equal D, and MLB has settled every prior entry or confirmed its absence after its entry window closed.
